Z||000011||stsmithgt||03-14-2001||11:13 AM||||Those fans look like a good idea especially in traffic.  My car warms up quick in traffic.  If they blew up and out of the vents w/o the scoops, it would be pretty effective.  I can't believe I said without the scoops.  I love scoops.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  With a tempature sensor to turn them on would keep them from having to run full time or have to use a manual switch. I know the leaf gaurd would have to go or change.  Would the stock air cleaner or battery get in the way?<p>[This message has been edited by stsmithgt (edited 03-14-2001).]||||reg||1
